WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Build versus buy. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: List cost, time and capability trade-offs

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Build-versus-buy compares total cost, time, capability, risk and service—not just the visible purchase price.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Add tooling, labor, inspection and rework to an in-house option before comparing it with a supplier quote.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Decision matrix

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Teaching relationships only—not live quotes, prices, tax advice or forecasts.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: List cost, time and capability trade-offs
